  "description": "To save her noble family from ruin, Nadia Sordi agrees to an arranged marriage with a stranger. When she goes to meet her future husband, she mistakenly believes it to be a man named Yuri, who convinces her to follow him home. Meanwhile, Pyotr, Nadia's actual prospective partner, arrives late and finds the scantily-clad Katerina waiting for him instead. By the time the four realize they've each met the wrong person, they've already come too far to change...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
